    "detailed_description": "You are a goblin, an alien species recently brought to the brink of extinction. You must find your way out of the temple, turned prison, by any means necessary.<br>Find strange creatures, obscure and hidden secrets. Bring honor to your goblin ancestors!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346470/extras/fae021f986f5c5c7ac32fe17e7aa7381.avif?t=1706125012\" /></span>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the temple mega-structure by opening shortcuts leading back to where you started, allowing for easy traversal through the building. <br></li><li>Unlock upgrades to make your journey easier.<br></li><li>Use your trusty automatic slingshot to stay safe from those that wish to catch you.<br></li><li>Make sure you are prepared for the final battle.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Other Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Giant tower with a generator powering a single elevator<br></li><li>Funny little names for each area<br></li><li>Jumping puzzles<br></li><li>Future updates to the game, it's an ever expanding creature</li></ul><br>*Many goblins were harmed in the making of this game, don't let their sacrifice be in vain.*<br><br>Move: WASD<br>Run: Left Shift<br>Aim: Right Mouse Button<br>Pick up objects while aiming by pressing E<br>Fire With Left Mouse Button While Aiming",
    "about_the_game": "You are a goblin, an alien species recently brought to the brink of extinction. You must find your way out of the temple, turned prison, by any means necessary.<br>Find strange creatures, obscure and hidden secrets. Bring honor to your goblin ancestors!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346470/extras/fae021f986f5c5c7ac32fe17e7aa7381.avif?t=1706125012\" /></span>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the temple mega-structure by opening shortcuts leading back to where you started, allowing for easy traversal through the building. <br></li><li>Unlock upgrades to make your journey easier.<br></li><li>Use your trusty automatic slingshot to stay safe from those that wish to catch you.<br></li><li>Make sure you are prepared for the final battle.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Other Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Giant tower with a generator powering a single elevator<br></li><li>Funny little names for each area<br></li><li>Jumping puzzles<br></li><li>Future updates to the game, it's an ever expanding creature</li></ul><br>*Many goblins were harmed in the making of this game, don't let their sacrifice be in vain.*<br><br>Move: WASD<br>Run: Left Shift<br>Aim: Right Mouse Button<br>Pick up objects while aiming by pressing E<br>Fire With Left Mouse Button While Aiming",
